[Em]Though [Em]I [E]pray my life [B]somehow [B]be [B]saved,
[B7]If [Bm7]the [Em]bearing of the [A]cross must come
Before [C]I wear the crown,
[B]I [B7]yield my [E]life [Em]to [D]You; I lay it down.
